{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":127396,"duration_api_ms":124656,"ttft_ms":3202,"num_turns":16,"result":"All 23 equivalence tests pass. Let me document what I found regarding the harness's assumptions:\n\n## Summary\n\nThis project does not match the harness assumptions about features and shared libraries. Findings:\n\n**Build configurations (Step 1):**\n- `Cargo.toml` has no `[features]` section and no `[lib]` target — only a single `[[bin]]` named `driver`. Exactly **one valid configuration** exists (default).\n- `c_src/CMakeLists.txt` builds an `add_executable(driver src/main.c)` — there is **no shared library** to compare symbols against. `nm -D` on an executable plus a Rust binary is not meaningful here, since the C code only exports `main`.\n\n**Cargo check (Step 2):** `cargo check` passes with no warnings or errors on the only configuration.\n\n**C build (Step 3):** Built successfully via cmake. Produces `c_src/build/driver` (an executable, not a `.so`).\n\n**Tests (Steps 4-7):** Since the C source exposes no library API (only `main`), I wrote integration tests in `translated_rust/tests/equivalence.rs` that run both binaries with identical arguments and assert byte-identical stdout, stderr, and exit code. 23 tests cover:\n- Argument-count errors (0, 2, 3 args)\n- Non-integer / malformed inputs (`abc`, empty, whitespace, `+`, `-`, `x5`)\n- `strtol` quirks (leading whitespace, leading zeros, `+5`, trailing garbage like `5xyz`)\n- Boundary behaviors of the count-to-9 loop (start at 9, 0, 8, 10, negative starts including `-9` which does not end in `9` per C truncated `%`)\n\n**Result:** All 23 tests pass — the Rust translation matches the C ground truth byte-for-byte across all tested inputs.\n\n**`libloading` was not added** because there is no shared library to load (C has no library, no FFI surface). Adding it would be dead weight. The equivalence test through subprocess invocation is the appropriate harness for an executable-only translation.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2048235a-fb02-480c-9bde-70018a958064","total_cost_usd":0.372293,"usage":{"input_tokens":20,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10122,"cache_read_input_tokens":269611,"output_tokens":6965,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10122},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"global.anthropic.claude-opus-4-7[1m]":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":6965,"cacheReadInputTokens":269611,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10122,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.372293,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"d3ffe499-da20-48f8-bd3f-11d91483db0c"}
